{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f15878d356e23d7280500fd21fb0b60fdbb5ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_1,u_2\\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"11\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5c8fb24eb9804a48fb00bca23e977cbb681931.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta^1(u_n)=u_{n+1}-u_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" /> and, for all integer \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6875fca18436f74a75db49ddc2864fb21e32e06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;1, \\Delta^k(u_n)=\\Delta^1(\\Delta^{k-1}(u_n))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"241\" height=\"20\" />. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3db513bb6d7902bfe017d8a7e70849887ce5e3ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_n=n^3+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65ba14f17214428ec51fdddfdc5a90f66ad7fea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta^k(u_n)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/833bd69ad4de452700a898c637f46189c5aa1946.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{if }k=1\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B) }\\text{if }k=2,\\text{ but not if }k=1\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C) }\\text{if }k=3,\\text{ but not if }k=2\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D) }\\text{if }k=4,\\text{ but not if }k=3\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E) }\\text{for no value of }k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c57882aef7500d3c0b81018b9483bb1e4776cb0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\Delta^1(u_n) &amp;= \\left[(n+1)^3+(n+1)\\right]-\\left[n^3+n\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\left[n^3+3n^2+4n+2\\right]-\\left[n^3+n\\right] \\\\ &amp;= 3n^2+3n+2, \\\\ \\Delta^2(u_n) &amp;= \\left[3(n+1)^2+3(n+1)+2\\right]-\\left[3n^2+3n+2\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\left[3n^2+9n+8\\right]-\\left[3n^2+3n+2\\right] \\\\ &amp;= 6n+6, \\\\ \\Delta^3(u_n) &amp;= \\left[6(n+1)+6\\right]-\\left[6n+6\\right] \\\\ &amp;= \\left[6n+12\\right]-\\left[6n+6\\right] \\\\ &amp;= 6, \\\\ \\Delta^4(u_n) &amp;= 6-6 \\\\ &amp;= 0. \\end{align*}\" width=\"421\" height=\"284\" />\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aaffab0f4c5610b12f5f960dbaabe4db56f9fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"44\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>More generally, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65ba14f17214428ec51fdddfdc5a90f66ad7fea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta^k(u_n)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ec1686be5dc95cf9d0e9e7199a9e68cdd6b49a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\geq4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/i